<p id="A1.SS11.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Post hoc results using the Wilcoxon signed-rank tests are provided for individual and social dining in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table A7 ‣ A.11.2. Wilcoxon Signed-Rank Test ‣ A.11. Statistical Testing ‣ Appendix A Appendices ‣ WAFFLE: A Wearable Approach to Bite Timing Estimation in Robot-Assisted Feeding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A7</span></a> and Table <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table A8 ‣ A.11.2. Wilcoxon Signed-Rank Test ‣ A.11. Statistical Testing ‣ Appendix A Appendices ‣ WAFFLE: A Wearable Approach to Bite Timing Estimation in Robot-Assisted Feeding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A8</span></a> respectively.</p>
