<div id="A1.SS12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Phase 2 raw data for bite timing is provided in Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table A9 ‣ A.12. Phase 2 and 3 Raw Data ‣ Appendix A Appendices ‣ WAFFLE: A Wearable Approach to Bite Timing Estimation in Robot-Assisted Feeding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A9</span></a>. Phase 2 and 3 Likert item raw data is provided in Table <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table A10 ‣ A.12. Phase 2 and 3 Raw Data ‣ Appendix A Appendices ‣ WAFFLE: A Wearable Approach to Bite Timing Estimation in Robot-Assisted Feeding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A10</span></a>-<a href="#A1.T15" title="Table A15 ‣ A.12. Phase 2 and 3 Raw Data ‣ Appendix A Appendices ‣ WAFFLE: A Wearable Approach to Bite Timing Estimation in Robot-Assisted Feeding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A15</span></a>.</p>
</div>
